          "chunk_id": "s05_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c2_draws_gaussian_sketching_matrix_form",
          "text": "It draws a Gaussian sketching matrix S and forms the sketch A times S, a randomized rangefinder for the column space of A, then quantizes it to get Q of A S.",
