          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_next_least_squares_projects_columns",
          "text": "Next it least-squares-projects A's columns onto this quantized basis, solving for the projection W star, then quantizes W star too, returning factors L and R.",
