          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_key_insight_gaussian_sketches_johnso",
          "text": "The key insight: Gaussian sketches are Johnson-Lindenstrauss embeddings with an equalization property, so reconstruction error stays order one and doesn't grow with dimension, keeping LPLR accurate even at one bit.",
